{"metadata":{"author":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},4],"title":[{"Plain":"“弱 n-范畴”"},2],"ext":[{"Plain":"md"},1],"taxon":[{"Plain":"百科. "},3],"slug":[{"Plain":"弱n-范畴"},0]},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<blockquote>\n<p>也许不应该组合地寻找弱 $n$-范畴的模型, 而是从同伦型出发 ("},{"Local":{"url":"同伦假设","text":"同伦假设"}},{"Plain":")</p>\n</blockquote>\n<h2>严格 $n$-范畴概念的失败</h2>\n<p>错误的论文: Kapranov &amp; Voevodsky <em>$\\infty$-groupoids and homotopy types</em></p>\n<p>反例 (Carlos Simpson, <em>Homotopy types of strict $3$-groupoids</em>): $\\pi_{\\leq  3}(S^2)$ 不等价于严格 $3$-范畴.</p>\n<p>科普: A whrilwind tour</p>\n<p>Simpson, Homotopy Theory of Higher Categories (使用 "},{"Local":{"url":"Segal范畴","text":"Segal 范畴"}},{"Plain":")</p>\n"}]}}